000100 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
000200 PROGRAM-ID. AIXNATR.
000300* After the updates: read through the paths to see the alternate
000400* indexes VSAM maintained -- the moved record under its new DEPT,
000500* the deleted one gone, the inserted one in place, the refused one
000600* absent.
000700 ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
000800 INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
000900 FILE-CONTROL.
001000     SELECT AIX-FILE ASSIGN TO AIXBAS
001100         ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
001200         ACCESS IS DYNAMIC
001300         RECORD KEY IS AIX-KEY
001400         ALTERNATE RECORD KEY IS AIX-DEPT WITH DUPLICATES
001500         ALTERNATE RECORD KEY IS AIX-CODE
001600         FILE STATUS IS WS-STATUS.
001700 DATA DIVISION.
001800 FILE SECTION.
001900 FD  AIX-FILE
002000     LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD
002100     RECORD CONTAINS 80 CHARACTERS.
002200 01  AIX-RECORD.
002300     02  AIX-KEY                 PIC X(5).
002400     02  FILLER                  PIC X(5).
002500     02  AIX-DEPT                PIC X(3).
002600     02  AIX-CODE                PIC X(4).
002700     02  AIX-TEXT                PIC X(63).
002800 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
002900 01  WS-STATUS                   PIC XX VALUE '00'.
003000 PROCEDURE DIVISION.
003100 MAIN-PARA.
003200     OPEN INPUT AIX-FILE.
003300     DISPLAY 'OPEN INPUT ' WS-STATUS.
003400     MOVE 'AAA' TO AIX-DEPT.
003500     READ AIX-FILE KEY IS AIX-DEPT
003600         INVALID KEY DISPLAY 'NO AAA'.
003700     PERFORM SHOW.
003800     PERFORM NEXT-ONE 6 TIMES.
003900     MOVE 'C300' TO AIX-CODE.
004000     READ AIX-FILE KEY IS AIX-CODE
004100         INVALID KEY DISPLAY 'NO C300 ' WS-STATUS.
004200     PERFORM SHOW.
004300     MOVE 'C200' TO AIX-CODE.
004400     READ AIX-FILE KEY IS AIX-CODE
004500         INVALID KEY DISPLAY 'NO C200 ' WS-STATUS.
004600     MOVE 'DDD' TO AIX-DEPT.
004700     READ AIX-FILE KEY IS AIX-DEPT
004800         INVALID KEY DISPLAY 'NO DDD ' WS-STATUS.
004900     CLOSE AIX-FILE.
005000     DISPLAY 'CLOSE ' WS-STATUS.
005100     STOP RUN.
005500 NEXT-ONE.
005600     READ AIX-FILE NEXT
005700         AT END DISPLAY 'AT END ' WS-STATUS.
005800     IF WS-STATUS NOT = '10' PERFORM SHOW.
005900 SHOW.
006000     DISPLAY WS-STATUS ' ' AIX-KEY ' ' AIX-DEPT ' ' AIX-CODE.
